{"text": "When I came back from returning the buggy, Bill was putting bandages on his scratches and bruises. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A fire was burning at the mouth of the cave, and the boy was watching a pot of boiling coffee. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He pointed a stick at me and shouted, Do you dare to enter the camp of Red Chief. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the boys game, Bill was Old Hank the Trapper, and I was Snake eye the Spy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy loved camping in the cave so much that he forgot that he was a captive himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I like this fine, and I have never had so much fun in all my life, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At supper he told us that he hated school and that he had once owned a pet possum. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We went to bed late, but the boy kept us awake for hours, jumping up at every small sound. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At daybreak I was awakened by a series of terrible screams from Bill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy was sitting on Bills chest, waving the knife we used for bacon in a wild game. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I took the knife away, but from that moment Bills spirit was broken.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "I", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "r", "e", "t", "u", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "u", "g", "g", "y", ",", " ", "B", "i", "l", "l", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "p", "u", "t", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "a", "n", "d", "a", "g", "e", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "s", "c", "r", "a", "t", "c", "h", "e", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "r", "u", "i", "s", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "u", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "u", "t", "h", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ",